      "text": "Bar chart “FCA. 7 – Malaria confirmed – laboratory – in 2019” showing the number of laboratory-confirmed malaria cases by health facility, sorted from highest to lowest. Lupara District Hospital has the most (about 8 000), followed by Lupara NGO Hospital (about 4 300); Health Centre A and Dispensaries B, F and E have about 2 000–2 600, and Dispensary C the fewest (under 500).",
